times behind you. Sometimes she crawls toward you out of the dark ahead.You turn your head and she is there. Then she isn't.You will think you saw something. You won't be sure. Fifteen different encounters, never in the same place, never at the same moment.Bear Traps The creature (SmilingFlesh) now leaves traps along the paths you walk. Step on one and it snaps shut. Getting free takes a struggle — and that struggle makes noise.You will be ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T15:48:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310648","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4969050-1840944183774238","game_id":"steam-4969050","kind":"announcement","title":"Looking for Volunteer Playtesters!","summary":"Hey everyone! We are looking for volunteer playtesters for The Smiling Flesh! We plan to distribute test keys to players who enjoy horror-thrillers and want to help us shape the game.If you’re interested in joining our test team, head over to our Discord server and check out the dedicated test channel to apply and get started! https://discord.gg/SSVzq3QWz7","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T15:06:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774238","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4969050-1840310314354479","game_id":"steam-4969050","kind":"announcement","title":"The thing is coming for you","summary":"Every sound you make travels. Your footsteps. A chain you brushed past in thedark. A door you left open behind you.None of it is scripted. It listens, it goes to where the noise came from, and itsearches. It opens doors. It checks the places you would hide. But it gives itself away too. It breathes. It drags its feet. It makes onesound when it finds your trail and a different one when it loses it — and onceyou learn the difference, you can survive on hearing alone. The house works both ways. Clo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T15:52:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314354479","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4969050":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T21:51:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T21:51:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4969050":"2026-10-25T21:51:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4969050":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T21:51:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T21:51:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5215940":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T21:51:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T21:51:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
